# 锐捷设备 show interfaces status 命令解析模板
# 获取端口名称、VLAN、双工模式、速率、类型
# 支持所有接口类型：FastEthernet, GigabitEthernet, TenGigE, VLAN, Loopback 等
# 示例输出：
# Interface                        Status    Vlan  Duplex   Speed     Type
# -------------------------------- --------  ----  -------  --------- ------
# FastEthernet 1/0                 up        1     Full     100M      copper
# GigabitEthernet 0/0              up        1     Full     1G        copper
# VLAN 10                           up        10    Full     1G        --
# Loopback 0                       up       --    --       --        --

Value Required INTERFACE (\S+(?:\s+[\d/]+)?)
Value VLAN (\d+|--)
Value DUPLEX (\S+|--)
Value SPEED (\S+|--)
Value TYPE (.*|--)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Status\s+Vlan\s+Duplex\s+Speed\s+Type
  ^-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+\S+\s+${VLAN}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s+${TYPE} -> Record
